00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.670
into slave labor by the Goblimon.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.310
So Takui came up with a plan to save the little guys.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:16.390
Once the fighting started, they all met the head honcho Sneemon.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.310
