00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:22.710
But when the spirit of thunder was uncovered,

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.990
JP jumped at the chance to spirit evolve to Beetlemon.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.790
He used his thunder fist to squash Sneemon like a beetle

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:30.910
that he was.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:32.000
